+    """Deferred commit (VLLM_GDN_RECOVER_FOLD=1), per cache group, indexed by
+    the runner's request-table row.
+
+    half[r]: ring half the last verify of request r wrote its records to.
+    pending[r]: accepted records of that half not folded into the state yet
+    (the next verify folds them first; 0 after a forced fold or a reset).
+
+    The post-sampling plan only updates these (and force-folds rows whose
+    accepted tokens cross a prefix-cache block boundary). A request-table row
+    is reset when a request is admitted to it, so a new or resumed request
+    never folds its predecessor's records."""
